{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2022-04-28 06:30:00', 'title': 'TEXTRON REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TEXTRON INC. (NYSE: TXT) TODAY REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2022 NET INCOME OF $0.88 PER SHARE, COMPARED WITH $0.75 PER SHARE, OR $0.70 PER SHARE OF ADJUSTED NET INCOME, A NON-GAAP MEASURE THAT IS DEFINED AND RECONCILED TO GAAP IN AN ATTACHMENT TO THIS RELEASE, IN THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021. “IN THE QUARTER, WE SAW HIGHER OVERALL REVENUES, NET OPERATING PROFIT AND CASH GENERATION AS COMPARED TO LAST YEAR'S FIRST QUARTER,” SAID TEXTRON CHAIRMAN AND CEO SCOTT C. DONNEL"}